**How to implement.** Declare in OpticalConstructor.Domain the measured-data load seam: [<ReferenceEquality>] ExperimentDataProxy = { tryLoadIntensity : DataFilePath -> Result<IntensitySeries, ExperimentDataError>; tryLoadEllipsometric : DataFilePath -> Result<EllipsometricSeries, ExperimentDataError> } (DataFilePath from step 25, the series and error types from step 34). Provide a mock (canned series keyed by path) plus a mock-driven test in OpticalConstructor.Tests exercising both fields through their exact signatures.

**Acceptance.** After the step, a mock-driven test MUST build a stub ExperimentDataProxy and exercise tryLoadIntensity and tryLoadEllipsometric through their exact signatures; it passes.
